      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Started doing more tests, seems it pretty consistently crashes after 5 mins. I've found the issue needs to be related somehow to however vrchat is set up with my computer. VRChat with the same account works fine on my laptop, with that I ruled out my isp and router. I tried completely disabling nord vpn and cloudshare warp with no avil. I've turned IPv6 on and off, no change. I tried different beta versions with no change. I tried clearing my data on vrchat a few times and no change there. I have no idea what's doing this or how else to root it out",
