      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had a similar issue, although for me it happend way later and hasnt happend since last night. \n\nSomething in vrchat caused my network to shutdown. I had been in this world group instance for a bit longer then 15m (I think) and had been playing for atleast 2 hours. then suddenly at exactly 3am on the minute it shutdown. I waited 5 minutes for everything to restart and reconnected. logging into vrchat was fine, calibrated my fbt and whent back to that same lobby only to get shutdown again instantly after the loading screen into that same instance",
